    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022010/extras/8ef46746bc25fd9f176b3a108be477d7.avif?t=1753205366\" width=609 height=303 /></span><br><br>Imagine being confined to your bed by sleep paralysis, unable to move, while something keeps you company in the darkness of your room on a stormy, rainy night. Your only hope is to survive until dawn, using your wits to overcome fear and stay calm. But here comes the real challenge: every blink counts. Can you maintain your sanity and survive until daylight dispels the night terrors?<br><br>Welcome to Bonanit, a 100% random game where no two playthroughs are the same. Each night brings new horrors, and every moment of sleep paralysis tests your mental resilience. The sinister atmosphere intensifies with every whisper in the dark, where each decision could be your last.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022010/extras/titulos-22.png?t=1753205366\" width=609 height=303 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022010/extras/07c25e3e94c2812400c79be29cc7ef62.poster.avif?t=1753205366\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022010/extras/07c25e3e94c2812400c79be29cc7ef62.webm?t=1753205366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022010/extras/07c25e3e94c2812400c79be29cc7ef62.mp4?t=1753205366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022010/extras/4e53045797866c55763a44e52d0ddb57.webp?t=1753205366\" width=526 height=45 /></span><br>In 